# Line endings are not a local preference in this repository.
#
# bash runs tests/run_tests.sh and the two lib/*.sh scripts. A CRLF checkout
# makes bash fail on the harness itself -- "$'\r': command not found" -- and
# whether that happens would otherwise depend on the core.autocrlf setting of
# whichever Windows machine or CI image checked the tree out. The regression
# goldens are compared as LF text for the same reason. Declaring it here makes
# the working tree identical on every platform regardless of that setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-for-byte, never normalised: the vendored static archives, the VCF/BCF
# fixtures, and the gzipped goldens. Git's own detection would almost
# certainly classify all of these as binary on its own, but "almost certainly"
# is not the standard for a file whose entire purpose is to be compared
# byte-for-byte against a program's output.
*.a       binary
*.gz      binary
*.bcf     binary
*.bundle  binary
